msgid "The Solers AI module is not compiled into this build."
msgstr "当前构建未编译 Solers AI 模块。"

msgid "provider requires an API key (set one in AI settings or via its environment variable)."
msgstr "该服务商需要 API 密钥（请在 AI 设置中填写，或通过其环境变量提供）。"

msgid "model is empty; Solers will need an explicit model before inference."
msgstr "模型为空；推理前 Solers 需要明确指定一个模型。"

msgid "base_url must start with http:// or https://."
msgstr "服务地址必须以 http:// 或 https:// 开头。"

msgid "remote provider base_url is not HTTPS."
msgstr "远程服务商的服务地址未使用 HTTPS。"

