msgid "Qwen / Alibaba Cloud Model Studio"
msgstr "通义千问 / 阿里云百炼"

msgid "Use native Anthropic Messages for provider-specific features."
msgstr "使用 Anthropic 原生 Messages 协议以获得其特有功能。"

msgid "OpenAI-compatible endpoint is useful for shared gateway code; native API can expose Gemini-specific features."
msgstr "OpenAI 兼容端点便于复用通用网关代码；原生 API 可启用 Gemini 专属功能。"

msgid "Provider model aliases can change; Solers validates shape, not remote availability."
msgstr "服务商的模型别名可能变化；Solers 只校验配置形态，不校验远端可用性。"

msgid "Default is the Beijing-region DashScope compatible-mode endpoint; international accounts use dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com."
msgstr "默认为北京地域的 DashScope 兼容模式端点；国际站账号请使用 dashscope-intl.aliyuncs.com。"

msgid "Local runtime. API key is required by some clients but ignored by Ollama."
msgstr "本地运行时。部分客户端要求填写 API 密钥，但 Ollama 会忽略它。"

msgid "Local server defaults to port 1234; model id depends on loaded model."
msgstr "本地服务默认端口 1234；模型 ID 取决于已加载的模型。"

msgid "For LiteLLM, OpenRouter-style, vLLM, or private gateway deployments."
msgstr "适用于 LiteLLM、OpenRouter 类中转、vLLM 或私有网关部署。"

